sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STW as Data Protection Steward
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AccessPoliciesController
    participant S as AccessPolicyService
    participant G as IAccessGuardService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STW->>W: Link role "Wellbeing Advisor" to purpose "Wellbeing support"
    W->>C: POST /api/AccessPolicies {consentPurposeId, roleId}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Check purpose not retired, role is not Student, no live policy for the same pair
    S->>R: CreateAsync(policy, status = draft)
    R->>DB: INSERT ACCESSPOLICIES
    W->>C: POST /api/AccessPolicies/{id}/test {studentId}
    C->>S: TestAsync(AccessPolicyId, request)
    S->>R: Read the student's consents under the purpose (nothing is logged)
    S-->>C: Which attributes the role would see
    W->>C: PUT /api/AccessPolicies/{id}/activate
    C->>S: ActivateAsync(AccessPolicyId)
    S->>R: UpdateAsync(status = active)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACCESSPOLICIES
    Note over G: From now on the access guard allows this role to read the attributes students granted under the purpose
